          <td valign=top>
            <a name="DESC">
            Summer is upon us and I cannot possibly justify paying for all these accounts when I am not going to be playing, so it is liquidation time. Step right into the endgame and buy this level 65 troll warrior currently on Legends (home server of Bristlebane but can be moved anywhere if you want to pay extra). This character has 362AAs and very sweet gear (several nice time loots). Check out his magelo: . …………………………………. http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=1006647 . . . ……………………………… Unbuffed (w/o tribute) he has about 8300 hitpoints and 1800 AC.  He also has his epic (in case the next quest in Omens is worth anything), and tons of neat toys; Willsapper (procs slow), Bloodied Berserker's Blade (for when you're not tanking), Kizrak's Gaunts (self haste click), 10th coldain ring (DS and regen click), Bloody Ancilles Pouch (summons arrows), Bow of Contortion, Shrunken Gobby Earring (attack), Cobby Bracer (shrink), Greatstaff of the Four Winds, Binden Concerrentia (unlimited charge gate talisman), Spined Chain Mail (ds click), Blazing Vambraces (another DS), and lots more in the bank. He is flagged through the plane of time, but other than AAs he has not adventured much in GoD. He has health 2 for leader AAs and about halfway to health 3.  Also included on the account is a level 52 iksar monk with his epic and the eypatch of plunder (as well as some other decent no drop armor and items) and a 54 dwarf rogue with his epic and other items.  The account has all expansions through GoD (I have not pre-ordered Omens),  The account is active and the warrior has just had his name changed on Stormhammer (the monk and rogue are eligible as well). It is, of course, in good standing on Legends and on Bristlebane. I will accept western union, USPS money order, or verified paypal (where the buyer’s e-mail matches their PA e-mail). Please do not bid on the account if you have less than 5 positive feedbacks on PA (prefer them to be a bit spread out). I reserve the right to discuss this transaction with you on the phone if you plan to use paypal and I suspect something is amiss. I am a highly ethical seller and I choose to do business with only ethical buyers. My feedback reflects this, so bid with confidence.  Contact me with questions, I CAN move the account at your expense, I don't have CD keys (nor do you need them), and I won't take trades or payments. Happy bidding and au revoir EQ.
            <br>
            <br>
            
